Yes. Alkapuri offers a wide selection of ready-to-move resale flats, newly completed boutique projects, and luxury redeveloped apartments.

### 4. How far is Alkapuri from Vadodara Railway Station and Airport?
Alkapuri is located just 5 minutes (2 km) from Vadodara Central Railway Station and approximately 15 minutes (8 km) from Vadodara International Airport.

### 5. Can I get a bank home loan for buying a flat in Alkapuri?
Yes. Almost all major banks (SBI, HDFC, ICICI, Bank of Baroda) offer pre-approved home loans up to 80-90% for RERA and VMC-approved properties in Alkapuri.

### 6. Are luxury penthouses with smart home features available in Alkapuri?
Yes. Premium projects offer 4/5 BHK penthouses featuring smart lighting, app-controlled security, private terrace gardens, and dedicated parking.

### 7. What legal documents should I check before buying a flat in Alkapuri?
Verify Title Clearance Report, VMC Approved Building Plan, BU (Building Use) Permission, GUJRERA Registration, AnyRoR 7/12 extracts, and Encumbrance Certificate.

### 8. Is Althan or Alkapuri good for high rental income in Gujarat?
Alkapuri is exceptionally strong for corporate rental income, attracting MNC managers, bank executives, and university professors with 4-6% annual yields.

### 9. Can NRIs purchase residential property in Alkapuri?
Yes. NRIs can freely buy residential flats in Alkapuri under RBI and FEMA regulations using NRE/NRO account channels.

### 10. Why search for flats in Alkapuri on PropertysDeal?
PropertysDeal provides 100% verified listings in Alkapuri with HD photos, transparent pricing, direct developer/seller access, interactive map search, and complete home loan assistance.

