### 1. Gota & Chandkheda (North West Corridor)
- **Highlights**: Direct SG Highway & Metro connectivity, close to Gandhinagar and GIFT City influence zone.
- **Budget Segment**: 1 BHK & 2 BHK flats from ₹35 Lakhs to ₹50 Lakhs.

