Sanand (Automobile/Engineering), Vatva & Naroda (Chemical/MSME), Changodar (Logistics/Warehousing), Ankleshwar & Vapi (Chemical/Pharma), and Sachin (Textiles).

### 3. What is the process of buying a GIDC shed in resale?
Obtain GIDC Transfer Permission, execute a registered Assignment/Sale Deed, pay applicable GIDC transfer fees, and transfer utility connections (Power & Water).

### 4. Can I get a bank loan for purchasing a GIDC industrial shed?
Yes. Major nationalized banks, SIDBI, and private lenders offer industrial property loans up to 75-80% of the property value.

