Alkapuri is Vadodara''s premier posh locality, offering unmatched infrastructure, central connectivity, elite schools, top hospitals, luxury retail along RC Dutt Road, and strong capital appreciation.

### 2. What is the price of a 2 BHK or 3 BHK flat in Alkapuri?
